<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Micor buys Goscor for 36 million rand.</title>
<headline>Micor buys Goscor for 36 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micor Industrial Corp Ltd said on Thursday it had agreed to buy materials handling firm Goscor (Pty) Ltd for 36 million rand.</p>
<p>The purchase will be settled by the issue of three millioon shares at 700 cents and 15 million in cash.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
